<section class="footer-info" id="about">
  <div class="info-panel"><span class="micro">ABOUT</span><h2>END CULTURE</h2><p>END CULTURE is an independent menswear label established in 2026. The first release focuses on graphic T-shirts and headwear with a clean, understated identity.</p><a href="{{ routes.search_url }}?view=t-shirts">VIEW THE FIRST COLLECTION →</a></div>
  <div class="info-grid">
    <article id="shipping"><h3>SHIPPING</h3><p>We aim to prepare and dispatch orders as quickly as possible. Available delivery services, charges and estimated delivery times will be shown at checkout before you place your order.</p><p>Once your order has been dispatched, you will receive confirmation using the contact details provided at checkout. Delivery estimates are not guaranteed and may be affected by carrier delays or other circumstances outside our control.</p></article>
    <article id="returns"><h3>RETURNS</h3><p>If you change your mind, you can request a return within 14 days of receiving your order. Once a return has been requested, you then have 14 days to send the item back.</p><p>Items should be unworn, unused and returned in their original condition with any tags attached. This does not affect your rights if an item is faulty, damaged or not as described.</p><p>To start a return, contact us with your order number before sending anything back. Unless the item is faulty or we have made an error, return postage is the customer's responsibility.</p></article>
    <article id="privacy"><h3>PRIVACY</h3><p>END CULTURE is operated by Orion GLE Ltd. We collect and use personal information where necessary to operate this website, process and fulfil orders, take payments, provide customer support, prevent fraud, comply with legal obligations and, where you have chosen to receive them, send marketing and product-release updates.</p><p>Depending on the purpose, we process information because it is necessary to perform our contract with you, comply with a legal obligation, pursue our legitimate business interests, or because you have given consent. We may share information with service providers that help us operate the store, including Shopify, payment providers, delivery carriers and other technology or professional service providers where necessary.</p><p>We keep personal information only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purpose for which it was collected, including legal, accounting, tax, fraud-prevention and dispute requirements. You may have rights over your personal information including access, correction, deletion, restriction, portability and objection, depending on the circumstances. Where processing relies on consent, you can withdraw that consent.</p><p>For privacy enquiries or to exercise your rights, contact <a href="mailto:info@endculture.co.uk">info@endculture.co.uk</a>. You also have the right to complain to the UK Information Commissioner's Office if you are unhappy with how your personal information is handled.</p><p>Our store may use cookies and similar technologies. Where consent is required for non-essential cookies, these should only be used after you have made your choice.</p></article>
    <article id="terms"><h3>TERMS</h3><p>END CULTURE is a trading brand operated by Orion GLE Ltd. These terms apply when you use this website or place an order with us. By placing an order, you confirm that the information you provide is accurate and that you are authorised to use the chosen payment method.</p><p>Product descriptions, images, sizes, availability and prices are provided as accurately as reasonably possible. Colours and appearance may vary slightly depending on screens and manufacturing tolerances. Products marked Coming Soon are previews only and cannot be purchased until released.</p><p>An order is subject to acceptance. We may refuse or cancel an order where, for example, a product is unavailable, pricing or product information contains an obvious error, payment is not authorised, or we reasonably suspect fraud. If we cancel an order after payment has been taken, the relevant amount will be refunded.</p><p>For online purchases, consumers normally have the legal right to cancel within 14 days after receiving the goods, subject to applicable exceptions. Your statutory rights in relation to faulty, damaged or misdescribed goods are not affected by these terms. Please see our Returns information for the process.</p><p>We are not responsible for losses that were not reasonably foreseeable when the contract was formed, or for business losses arising from a consumer purchase. Nothing in these terms excludes or limits liability where it would be unlawful to do so, including liability that cannot legally be excluded for faulty or misdescribed goods.</p><p>These terms are governed by the laws applicable in England and Wales, without removing any mandatory consumer protections or rights you may have under applicable law. Questions can be sent to <a href="mailto:info@endculture.co.uk">info@endculture.co.uk</a>.</p></article>
    <article id="faq"><h3>FAQ</h3><p><strong>When does END CULTURE launch?</strong><br>Drop 001 is coming soon. Join the list and follow the drops below for release updates.</p><p><strong>What is Drop 001?</strong><br>Drop 001 starts with END CULTURE T-shirts, including our first white T-shirt. Product details are being revealed as we get closer to release.</p><p><strong>Will there be more drops?</strong><br>Yes. 001 is only the beginning. Drop 002 and Drop 003 are already on the board — but we're keeping them under wraps for now.</p></article>
    <article id="contact"><h3>CONTACT</h3><p>Send END CULTURE a message using the form below.</p>{% form 'contact' %}<input type="text" name="contact[name]" placeholder="NAME" required><input type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="EMAIL" required><textarea name="contact[body]" placeholder="MESSAGE" rows="4" required></textarea><button type="submit">SEND MESSAGE →</button>{% if form.posted_successfully? %}<p>MESSAGE SENT. THANK YOU.</p>{% endif %}{{ form.errors | default_errors }}{% endform %}</article>
  </div>
  <div class="drops-board" id="drops"><div class="drops-head"><span class="micro">END CULTURE / RELEASE ARCHIVE</span><h2>THE DROPS</h2><p>001 IS REVEALED. WHAT COMES NEXT STAYS HIDDEN — FOR NOW.</p></div><div class="drops-grid"><a class="drop-card drop-live" href="{{ routes.search_url }}?view=t-shirts"><span>DROP</span><strong>001</strong><p>T-SHIRTS</p><em>EXPLORE 001 →</em></a><div class="drop-card drop-locked"><span>DROP</span><strong>002</strong><p>CLASSIFIED</p><em>NOT YET.</em></div><div class="drop-card drop-locked"><span>DROP</span><strong>003</strong><p>CLASSIFIED</p><em>STAY CLOSE.</em></div></div></div>
</section>
